    rect 5 11 13 3 O
    rect 6 14 11 10 O
    rect 8 24 7 3 O
    rect 9 2 5 4 V
    rect 7 5 9 4 V
    rect 4 8 15 2 V
    rect 7 10 9 3 F
    rect 8 13 7 9 F
    rect 10 22 3 3 F
    rect 7 11 2 2 F
    rect 13 11 2 2 F
    rect 8 9 2 2 L
    rect 13 9 2 2 L
    rect 8 12 2 2 C
    rect 13 12 2 2 C
    rect 10 15 3 2 R
}
